### PHASE 19: USERS CONTROLLER LOCKDOWN

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userToken = Bearer <USER_JWT>
@adminUsersToken = Bearer <ADMIN_WITH_USERS_PERM_JWT>
@adminReportsToken = Bearer <ADMIN_WITH_REPORTS_ONLY_JWT>
@superUserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>
@userId = 2
@targetDeleteId = 6

### 1. Anonymous POST /users blocked (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Unauthorized Super User",
  "email": "anon.su@teamforge.io",
  "role": "Super User"
}

### 2. Super User POST /users creates admin with password setup reset email (201 Created, no password in response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Operations Admin",
  "email": "ops.admin@teamforge.io",
  "role": "Administrator",
  "university": "IIT Bombay"
}

### 3. Login without password returns 400 PASSWORD_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "arjun.sharma@teamforge.io",
  "password": ""
}

### 4. Admin login without password returns 400 PASSWORD_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@teamforge.io"
}

### 5. Removed passwordless legacy login endpoint (404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "arjun.sharma@teamforge.io"
}

### 6. Self profile update with allow-listed fields only (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Sharma",
  "bio": "Full-stack engineer focused on distributed team systems.",
  "skills": ["TypeScript", "NestJS", "React"],
  "links": {
    "github": "https://github.com/arjunsharma"
  },
  "settings": {
    "compactMode": false
  }
}

### 7. Self profile update attempting role/xp mass-assignment (400 FIELD_NOT_ALLOWED + audit USER_UPDATE_REJECTED_FIELD)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Super User",
  "xp": 99999
}

### 8. Cross-user profile update blocked (403 NOT_YOUR_ACCOUNT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/3
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Unauthorized cross-user edit attempt."
}

### 9. Email change resets emailVerified, sends verification link, and revokes other sessions (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "arjun.updated@teamforge.io"
}

### 10. List all users restricted to Admin with 'users' permission or Super User (403 without 'users')
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{adminUsersToken}}

### 11. Inspect single user account restricted to owner or Admin with 'users' permission (403 for others)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 12. Super User deletes account with written reason (403 for non-Super User / Super User target, 409 on open obligations)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetDeleteId}}
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Confirmed policy violation after final review."
}
